OL,6,FMY FIRST ARCADE GAME - DEPTHCHARGE!    
OL,8, Episode three of Byte High is about the
OL,9, first ever arcade game I played as a   
OL,10, kid moving to Jaywick in 1983.         
OL,12, This was also an experiment for a You- 
OL,13, tube video (still available!)          
OL,14, Many lessons learned, mainly that audio
OL,15, is the way to go!                      
